SUMMARY:Play On Bloor West: Summer Sports Festival!
DESCRIPTION:Get in the Game. Feel the Summer.\nWhen: Saturday\, June 13\, 2026Time: 11:00 AM – 5:00 PMWhere: Green P Parking Lot ‘091’ (Bloor St W & Willard Ave) \n🌞 What to expect –  \n✅ Get in the Game with Soccer Activities\, Pitch + Putt Golf Fun\, HOOPS basketball\, crafts and more…\n✅ Vendor Market featuring BIA businesses\, handful of local makers\, artisans & community vendors.\n✅ Special Guests – Batman & the Batmobile\, plus Enjoy live stories with a Princess!\n✅ Join the Play On Bloor West Trivia Challenge to win Exciting Prizes\n✅ Discover Unique Shop Local Experiences & CaféTO Patio Specials all across the Village\n✅ Soccer-inspired Pilates & Yoga with Oxygen Yoga & Fitness High Park \nDiscover our Special Feature Installation!“Crank It Up” Soccer Sculpture – A unique\, trophy-inspired installation that invites visitors to turn a hand-crank and create music. \nThank you to our Sponsors & Community Partners –\nGillian Ritchie-Red Square Team Realty\, White Tooth Dental\, Sidorova Inwood Realty\, The White Horse Bar & Grill\, Ohana Wellness Clinic\, Iris Restaurant\, Scotia Bank\, Mellyfit Nutrition\, Sunshine Village Grill\, ZAZA Espresso Bar & Gelato\, D&D Party Rentals\, Green P Parking. \nStroll • Shop • Play On • Celebrate Summer with Us!
URL:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/event/play-on-bloor-west-summer-sports-festival/
LOCATION:Bloor West Village\, Bloor Street West and Willard Avenue (South side of the Street)\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6S 1P4\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.bloorwestvillagebia.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Website-Play-On.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Bloor West Village BIA":MAILTO:info@bloorwestvillagebia.com
END:VEVENT
